    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent, before a long deployment at sea far from hospital care. He named a health care agent and a second agent, and a health care proxy form was completed; both are recorded in the chart and are not named here. He wants full treatment if he is ill or injured, including evacuation to the nearest hospital. He asked for a short medical summary, including his malaria history and G6PD result, to carry with the ship&apos;s medical officer. The plan will be revisited before he sails. [S]</paragraph></text>

